ree  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  3 Cam5 2 immunostained levels  By his her signature below  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received are four containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled  right axilla sentinel node hot and blue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan pink to yellow nodular soft tissue  bisected and entirely frozen as FX 1  now resubmitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled  sentinel node left axilla 491   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm fatty soft tissue consistent with lymph node  bisected and entirely frozen as FX 2 and FX 2A  now resubmitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   respectively  Received fresh  labeled  simple mastectomy short stitch   superior  long stitch   lateral  left    is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm left simple mastectomy with a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The overlying REMOVED_DATE x 5 5cm tan skin ellipse contains a 3 0cm in diameter nipple areolar complex  The overlying skin and nipple areolar complex are grossly unremarkable  The specimen is inked as follows  Anterior   blue  posterior   black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable breast parenchyma  No axillary lymph nodes are identified  Representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  right simple mastectomy  short   superior  long   lateral   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm right simple mastectomy specimen with a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The overlying REMOVED_DATE x 6 0cm tan skin ellipse contains a 3 0cm nipple areolar complex  which is grossly unremarkable  There is a 4 0cm curvilinear  well healed scar superior and lateral t