bbery lymph nodes ranging from 0 3cm to 2 0cm are identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODES  A C  superior cavity  D   posterior margin closest to superior cavity  E   anterior margin closest to superior cavity  F H  lateral cavity  I   anterior margin closest to lateral cavity  J   posterior margin closest to lateral cavity  K   parenchyma between both cavities  L M  parenchyma away from both cavities  N Q  whole lymph nodes  multiple per cassette  R   one lymph node bisected  S T  one lymph node sectioned  Gross Description by  CHRISTINE D AMATO Resident  ELENA BRACHTEL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST RIGHT  MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
