ed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  09 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 13 48 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm piece of fibroadipose tissue  which reveals a 1 0cm white  tan  irregular mass  which abuts the inked margin  A representative section is frozen as frozen section  1  now in A  The remaining specimen is submitted entirely in B through D  Resident  STUART HOUSER  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  BREAST  RIGHT   BIOPSY  INFILTRATING INTRADUCTAL CARCINOMA  ABUTTING THE MARGIN  O R  Resident  Ross C  Wheeler  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST BIOPSY  RIGHT  , Unchecked.
